# test/remote/menu.k4r -- the F12 menu opens, is photographed, and closes.
#     tools/k4510-remote run test/remote/menu.k4r
# (the screen dump's first line says when the menu is over the machine)
# the machine's own colours first: a STARTUP.BAT may load another palette (Doc, 2026-09-15)
type PALETTE RESET\n
wait 1
key f12
expect "the menu is open" 5
shot menu
key esc
absent "the menu is open" 5
